          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1">
            <li><strong>Daybreak:</strong> Security initiative (June 2026)</li>
            <li><strong>Codex Security:</strong> CI/CD vuln scanner (free for OSS)</li>
            <li><strong>GPT-5.5-Cyber:</strong> Security model ($2.50/$10 per MTok)</li>
